{"translation":{"id":"pan_irv","name":"ਇੰਡਿਅਨ ਰਿਵਾਇਜ਼ਡ ਵਰਜ਼ਨ (IRV) - ਪੰਜਾਬੀ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=pan","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=pan","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"IRV","englishName":"Punjabi Indian Revised Version Bible","language":"pan","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"7bcf70d369a169a12ac867ce44def25b36147b72029339f8c8d3c7a06bab588d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31104,"languageName":"ਪੰਜਾਬੀ","languageEnglishName":"Punjabi"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"pan_irv","name":"ਜ਼ਬੂਰ","commonName":"ਜ਼ਬੂਰ","title":"ਜ਼ਬੂਰ","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"8a1b7c5c3025a80671b87659256d14a42fb58ace987b687a83db2b26ac8a5d95","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":100,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ਪਰਮੇਸ਼ੁਰ ਦੀ ਉਸਤਤ ਦਾ ਗੀਤ"]},{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["ਧੰਨਵਾਦ ਦਾ ਭਜਨ"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ਹੇ ਸਾਰੀ ਧਰਤੀ ਦੇ ਵਾਸੀਓ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਯਹੋਵਾਹ ਲਈ ਲਲਕਾਰੋ,","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਅਨੰਦ ਹੋ ਕੇ ਯਹੋਵਾਹ ਦੀ ਉਪਾਸਨਾ ਕਰੋ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਜੈ-ਜੈਕਾਰ ਕਰਦੇ ਹੋਏ ਉਸ ਦੀ ਹਜ਼ੂਰੀ ਵਿੱਚ ਆਓ।","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਜਾਣ ਰੱਖੋ ਕਿ ਯਹੋਵਾਹ ਹੀ ਪਰਮੇਸ਼ੁਰ ਹੈ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਉਸ ਨੇ ਸਾਨੂੰ ਸਾਜਿਆ","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਅਤੇ ਅਸੀਂ ਉਹ ਦੀ ਜੂਹ ਦੀਆਂ ਭੇਡਾਂ ਹਾਂ।","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਧੰਨਵਾਦ ਕਰਦੇ ਹੋਏ ਉਹ ਦੀ ਹੈਕਲ ਦੇ ਫਾਟਕਾਂ ਦੇ ਅੰਦਰ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਅਤੇ ਉਸਤਤ ਕਰਦੇ ਹੋਏ ਉਹ ਦੇ ਦਰਬਾਰ ਵਿੱਚ ਆਓ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਉਹ ਦਾ ਧੰਨਵਾਦ ਕਰੋ ਅਤੇ ਉਹ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਨੂੰ ਮੁਬਾਰਕ ਆਖੋ।","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਯਹੋਵਾਹ ਤਾਂ ਭਲਾ ਹੈ, ਉਹ ਦੀ ਦਯਾ ਸਦੀਪਕ ਹੈ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਅਤੇ ਉਹ ਦੀ ਵਫ਼ਾਦਾਰੀ ਪੀੜ੍ਹੀਓਂ ਪੀੜ੍ਹੀ ਤੱਕ ਹੈ।","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/100.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/101.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/99.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":5}